1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:03,310
(Missy:)Any news you want me
to pass along to Mom?

2
00:00:03,473 --> 00:00:06,813
(Sheldon:)Well, she might be interested to know
that I've refocused my research...

3
00:00:06,976 --> 00:00:10,016
(Sheldon:)...from bosonic string theory
to heterotic string theory.

4
00:00:11,064 --> 00:00:13,314
Yeah, I'll just tell her you said, "Hey."

5
00:00:15,151 --> 00:00:17,611
(Sheldon:)Okay. Well, it was pleasant seeing you.

6
00:00:17,779 --> 00:00:21,029
(Sheldon:)Other than that business
with my testicles.

7
00:00:22,283 --> 00:00:23,703
(Howard:)Come on, Shelly.

8
00:00:29,999 --> 00:00:32,089
(Missy:)I want you to know
I'm very proud of you.

9
00:00:32,252 --> 00:00:33,502
(Missy(who has just entered):)- Really?
- Yep.

10
00:00:33,670 --> 00:00:37,670
(Missy:)I'm always bragging to my friends
about my brother, the rocket scientist.

11
00:00:38,174 --> 00:00:40,844
(Sheldon:)You tell people I'm a rocket scientist?

12
00:00:42,011 --> 00:00:45,101
- Well, yeah.
- I'm a theoretical physicist.

13
00:00:45,265 --> 00:00:48,975
- What's the difference?
- What's the difference?

14
00:00:49,644 --> 00:00:53,484
- Goodbye, Shelly.
- My God.

15
00:00:53,648 --> 00:00:57,698
Why don't you just tell them that
I'm a toll taker at the Golden Gate Bridge?

16
00:01:00,071 --> 00:01:03,241
A rocket scientist, how humiliating.

